Phil,

Thanks for pointing those out -- I saw them as well.  However, the seller
states that the currently installed crystals are for 457.45/452.15, so
I assume those are the KS-960 model, which will only accept crystals in the
450-470 MHz range.  That's outside of the amateur band of course -- at least
here in the US.  The KS-960L and KS-900L accept crystals in the 430-450 MHz
range, which is what I'm looking for.

Jim, W6XE


